XMRAnd Mobile

This project provides Android and iOS wrappers and mobile adaptations for XMRig.
XMRig: https://github.com/xmrig/xmrig
License: GNU General Public License version 3 or later (see LICENSE).
Upstream copyright and third-party notices are retained in their source files.

Core source includes RandomX, CryptoNight, Argon2 and other upstream components.
Their individual notices and licenses are retained under src/.

Linked dependency sources for the provided builds:
- libuv 1.51.0: https://github.com/libuv/libuv (MIT and notices in LICENSE).
- OpenSSL 3.0.16: https://github.com/openssl/openssl (Apache License 2.0).
The release provides pristine source archives for these dependencies.

Optional iOS helpers are separate programs, downloaded by the preparer:
- StikDebug: https://github.com/StephenDev0/StikDebug
- LocalDevVPN: https://github.com/jkcoxson/LocalDevVPN
- idevice / idevice-tools: https://github.com/jkcoxson/idevice
Their source repositories contain their applicable licenses. Keep those licenses
when building or redistributing the helpers. No helper binaries are bundled here.

This project is not affiliated with Apple or Google. No Apple signing service,
account credentials, provisioning profiles or device-pairing records are supplied.
